-          <name slugifiedName="name-level-2-forwarding-database-this-database-is-kept-by-level-2-intermediate-systems.-it-is-used-to-determine-where-to-forward-a-data-npdu-with-des-tination-outside-this-system's-area.-record-adr:-addressprefix;-(*address-of-destination-area.-*)-i-mum-path-(*number-of-valid-output-adj's-for-reaching-adr-(0-indicates-it-is-unreachable)-*)-i-mum-path-pointer-to-adjacency;-(*pointer-to-adjacency-for-forwarding-to-destination-area.-*)-end;">Level 2 Forwarding Database This database is kept by Level 2 Intermediate systems. It is used to determine where to forward a data NPDU with des tination outside this system's area. RECORD adr: AddressPrefix; 	(*address of destination area. *) i mum Path (*Number of valid output adj's for reaching adr (0 indicates it is unreachable) *) i mum Path POINTER TO adjacency; (*Pointer to adjacency for forwarding to destination area. *) END;</name>
