+ISO10589-ISIS.neighbourSNPAAddress-Default
+GET-REPLACE,
+-- Note: should this be handled by an X.25 IVMO?
+ptPtCircuitID GET;
+REGISTERED AS {ISO10589-ISIS.poi 
